            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13900,
            "question_id": 16852,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Reject full intensity of the preceding training period.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13901,
            "question_id": 16852,
            "provider": "polyglot-v3",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: train. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13902,
            "question_id": 16852,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "pl",
            "hint": "Użyj Past Perfect Continuous dla wcześniejszego procesu. Zacznij od podmiotu zdania głównego; nie przenoś wyrażeń czasu ani przyczyny na początek. Przed finałem nie trenowaliśmy z pełną intensywnością.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
